_ui7zxEJgj8Q7kNvwFQMvyr&_nc_oc=Adr-WFegqbjkWiNrXNkPxx39565oGHT_0RcT-ZivjF-Qz7ZdfZQfaVjb54Ix5GXaavc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxsvsD3NfDSAnuc79G0uMAU2_HpXY68wbugAlKimPlNQg&oe=69CE79B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=alSpBlvgqCUQ7kNvwHY5mmc&_nc_oc=AdqzvtuFZA8K-ufznL4XNHl4s7F0yzBpAk4ti0GG4ijOCXk5_Cqh8v98Q7mto6lCuuw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxx_aI8JgLNYrX8RwwYicw_pWVv-XfMfAX7Rp1lRO-DtA&oe=69CE7B4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7uE4qaw6W8QQ7kNvwGsorlJ&_nc_oc=AdqcA7l4pb4eUVYvEyOIQbyK1Nbwh5LKbvdbf0erwtxiThD7KQM8CamwKNOGQFopWLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy_cnn29um6AjC6lmcc52N6oGEeokvkB4ZjSZGHcnEVuQ&oe=69CE686F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mYqOlAc5m1wQ7kNvwHDGitB&_nc_oc=AdpMm2sv5zHEiWaCunEdJzvNLfEjRgBIy_QPgxgnLlwcmJpQaBc4HHmI9rcSNo_2wu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzdgQYee6sQSYfInMPFvZvrNke8cRJ2DdwSpzSABXgR0A&oe=69CE51C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qz77PSupZ0Q7kNvwGVCk06&_nc_oc=AdrFbO47T8cBAtmvHxAkMzJIz4vBquWPjov07c_ISKPLeGo0y1d0UJQMTTogwZV8o7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzOS2-AhDAYnMTsFOyqdlmfJ-QB37lQ5hxqU0CRqWC16g&oe=69CE8258"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rKcayQ_QjS0Q7kNvwGXczZ3&_nc_oc=Adoew7WqJcqT57p03CgTJr_nyfRFXa97uQ5lr7TyhynDNuORL46BfYfjG-a551NwlvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzf9krSJMq62yCJobpj3l89CSxL-LSQqtSKnoPkzs_-Gg&oe=69CE5D3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080